# A pi with no provider to run a turn with, stopped where `/login` leaves it:
# the dialog asking for that provider's key, in the slot the composer had. The
# rows above the box are the vendor's own warning that it has no models, which
# is what a pane nobody has logged in carries from the moment it starts. The
# agent is still there afterwards, the way pi is: whoever is driving this
# scenario decides when it ends.
screen login
sleep 600000
